<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33140" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφαν-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>showing itself</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρυον ἐκφανὲς ἐκ λεπίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.102.4
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>); <i>brightshining</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστέρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artem.
					2.36
				</span></i>
			; less freq. of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. γιγνόμενος</span>
			<i>disclosing oneself</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ion</u>
				535b
			</span></i>; <i>plain, manifest</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἀνδρὸς ἐκφανὲς τέκμαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					244
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				250d
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφανῆ γένοιτο ὅπῃ ἔχει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					528c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἰδεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					398
				</span></i>
			, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.1.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κσ́</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>illustrious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.30
			</span></i>.</div>
